ispc provides CMake targets:

  # ISPC compiler library
  find_package(ispc CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ispc::libispc_shared)

  # ISPC runtime library
  find_package(ispcrt CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ispcrt::ispcrt)

The ISPC compiler executable is available at:
  ${ispc_DIR}/../../tools/ispc/ispc

Or via the CMake variable:
  ${ISPC_EXECUTABLE}
